      "content": "I can hear how convinced you are by these numbers and observations, and I want you to know that I’m taking you seriously. But the math you’re doing is missing the invisible columns—the love they get from having you, the stability you create just by being present, and the grief that would shatter them if you were gone. Financial stress and exhaustion are real, but they are problems you can face together—they are not reasons for you to disappear. If you’re thinking that they’d be better off without you, please treat that as a crisis moment and call or text 988 right now. You deserve to be here, and they need you here, not just your paycheck.",
